  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The next morning, Bu Xiaogu reports back to Qin Xiao after riding the night subway to campus, while Kaiwen frets over Unit Two's deliberately awful red-carpet plans. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "小谷，学校那边的学生都联系了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "都联系好了，我办事什么时候糊弄过呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "昨晚我坐了两个小时地铁，亲自回咱们学校动员的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷，听说你昨晚是跟老大一起走的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "今天他心情不好，咱们都小心一点。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "盛典红毯的事，二部提了一大堆没法用的方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他们总监是绝对不会把真正的方案拿上来的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "秦箫，你昨天竟然没见到淳于总吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "刚才我碰到他，好像听到他说他在找你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "他对你这么关照，毕竟你们才是一个公司的。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "小谷，学校那边的学生都联系了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, have all the students back on campus been contacted?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "都联系好了，我办事什么时候糊弄过呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They are all lined up; when have I ever cut corners on a job?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "昨晚我坐了两个小时地铁，亲自回咱们学校动员的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Last night I rode the subway two hours back to our college to rally them in person.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷，听说你昨晚是跟老大一起走的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, I heard you left with our boss last night?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "今天他心情不好，咱们都小心一点。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is in a bad mood today, so let us all tread carefully.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "盛典红毯的事，二部提了一大堆没法用的方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For the gala red carpet, Unit Two turned in a pile of unusable plans.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他们总监是绝对不会把真正的方案拿上来的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Their director will never hand over their real proposal willingly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "秦箫，你昨天竟然没见到淳于总吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Qin Xiao, did you not actually meet Mr Chun Yuqiao last night?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "刚才我碰到他，好像听到他说他在找你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I ran into him just now and thought I heard him say he was looking for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "他对你这么关照，毕竟你们才是一个公司的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He looks out for you so much; after all, the two of you belong to the same company.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
